   <div class="request-title-art"><h1>{page==='consultation'?t('Let’s talk about','Mari bincangkan'):t('Your location,','Lokasi anda,')} <br/><em>{page==='consultation'?t('your options.','pilihan anda.'):t('in perspective.','dengan lebih jelas.')}</em></h1><ToolIllustration kind={page==='custom'?'report':'conversation'}/></div>
   <p>{page==='consultation'?t('Starting a business after retirement, or planning your next outlet? We help you understand a report or explore locations around your budget and business needs.','Memulakan perniagaan selepas bersara, atau merancang cawangan baharu? Kami membantu anda memahami laporan atau meneroka lokasi mengikut bajet dan keperluan perniagaan.'):t('A custom report starts with your business profile and chosen location. Share your plans so the scope can be tailored to the decision you need to make.','Laporan tersuai bermula dengan profil perniagaan dan lokasi pilihan anda. Kongsi rancangan supaya skop kajian sesuai dengan keputusan anda.')}</p>
   <div class="service-promise"><span class="micro">{t('WHAT HAPPENS NEXT','LANGKAH SETERUSNYA')}</span>
    <ol class="process"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>{t('Share your brief','Kongsi butiran anda')}</h3><p>{t('Your business, budget and questions.','Perniagaan, bajet dan soalan anda.')}</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>{t('Agree the scope','Persetujui skop')}</h3><p>{t('Discuss the work, available evidence and a final quote.','Bincangkan kajian, bukti tersedia dan sebut harga akhir.')}</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>{page==='custom'?t('Receive your custom report','Terima laporan tersuai'):t('Talk through your options','Bincangkan pilihan anda')}</h3><p>{page==='custom'?t('Add a consultation if you would like guidance.','Tambah perundingan jika anda mahukan bimbingan.'):t('Understand findings or consider suitable locations.','Fahami dapatan atau pertimbangkan lokasi yang sesuai.')}</p></div></li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class="request-price">{page==='custom'?t('Full feasibility report from','Laporan kebolehlaksanaan penuh dari'):t('Optional consultation','Perundingan pilihan')}<strong>{page==='custom'?money(fullReportPrice):t('Request a quote','Minta sebut harga')}</strong><small>{t('Provisional pricing · final scope agreed together','Harga sementara · skop akhir dipersetujui bersama')}</small></div>
   <div class="notice">{t('Booth demo: save a fictional request on this device. Nothing is sent to a consultant and no payment is taken.','Demo pameran: simpan permintaan rekaan pada peranti ini. Tiada butiran dihantar kepada perunding dan tiada pembayaran dikenakan.')}</div>
   {#if page==='custom'}<p class="route-alternative">{t('Still choosing a location?','Masih memilih lokasi?')} <a href="#consultation">{t('Start with a consultation →','Mulakan dengan perundingan →')}</a></p>{/if}
  </div>
  {#key page}<RequestForm {lang} mode={page} initialArea={formArea} onSave={submitRequest}/>{/key}
 </section>
{:else if page==='dashboard'}
 <section class="shell page-heading dashboard-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">{demo?t('DEMONSTRATION WORKSPACE','RUANG DEMONSTRASI'):t('YOUR WORKSPACE','RUANG ANDA')}</span><h1>{t('Your business plans,','Rancangan perniagaan anda,')}<br/><em>{t('taking shape.','mula terbentuk.')}</em></h1><p>{demo?t('Your saved demo briefs, alongside a fictional example company.','Butiran demo tersimpan anda, bersama syarikat contoh rekaan.'):user?.email||t('Sign in to see your requests.','Log masuk untuk melihat permintaan anda.')}</p></div><div class="workspace-heading-art"><ToolIllustration kind="workspace"/></div>{#if demo}<button class="btn outline" onclick={()=>confirmReset=true}><RefreshCw size={16}/>{t('Reset demo','Tetapkan semula demo')}</button>{/if}</section>
 <section class="shell">{#if lastSaved}<div class="save-receipt" role="status"><span class="receipt-icon"><Check size={26}/></span><div><span class="micro">{t('SAVED ON THIS DEVICE','DISIMPAN PADA PERANTI INI')}</span><h2>{t('Demo request saved','Permintaan demo disimpan')}</h2><p>{lastSaved.company} · {lastSaved.area}</p><small>{t('Nothing was sent. No booking or payment was made. At the booth, discuss this brief with the LOKA WISE team.','Tiada butiran dihantar. Tiada tempahan atau pembayaran dibuat. Bincangkan butiran ini dengan pasukan LOKA WISE di pameran.')}</small></div></div>{/if}<div class="notice">{demo?t('Demo records stay in this browser. They are not real customers, paid orders or confirmed bookings.','Rekod demo kekal dalam pelayar ini. Ia bukan pelanggan sebenar, pesanan berbayar atau tempahan disahkan.'):t('Your requests and test orders are stored in your account. Payments are in test mode only.','Permintaan dan pesanan ujian disimpan dalam akaun anda. Pembayaran dalam mod ujian sahaja.')}</div><div class="dashboard-summary"><div><FileText size={23}/><strong>{records.filter(r=>r.kind==='report').length}</strong><span>{t('Report requests','Permintaan laporan')}</span></div><div><CalendarDays size={23}/><strong>{records.filter(r=>r.kind==='consultation').length}</strong><span>{t('Consultation requests','Permintaan perundingan')}</span></div><div><ShieldCheck size={23}/><strong>{demo?'DEMO':orders.length}</strong><span>{demo?t('No real payments','Tiada pembayaran sebenar'):t('Test orders','Pesanan ujian')}</span></div></div><div class="section-title"><h2>{t('Requests & activity','Permintaan & aktiviti')}</h2><a class="text-link" href="#custom">{t('New report request','Permintaan laporan baharu')} <ArrowUpRight size={16}/></a></div><div class="requests">{#each records as r}<article><div class="request-icon">{#if r.kind==='report'}<FileText size={23}/>{:else}<CalendarDays size={23}/>{/if}</div><div class="request-body"><span class="micro">{r.kind==='report'?t('CUSTOM REPORT','LAPORAN TERSUAI'):t('CONSULTATION','PERUNDINGAN')}</span><h3>{r.area} · {r.company}</h3><p>{r.message}</p>{#if r.date}<small>{t('Preferred date','Tarikh pilihan')}: {r.date}</small>{/if}</div>{#if r.kind==='report'&&!demo&&!orders.some(o=>o.request_id===r.id)}<button class="btn outline small" disabled={checkoutBusy} onclick={()=>checkout(r.id)}>{t('Test checkout','Pembayaran ujian')} · {money(fullReportPrice)}</button>{/if}<span class="badge">{r.id.startsWith('DEMO-')?t('Fictional example','Contoh rekaan'):demo?t('Saved locally','Disimpan setempat'):t('Requested','Diminta')}</span></article>{:else}<p class="empty">{t('No requests yet. Start with a location or tell us about your business.','Belum ada permintaan. Mulakan dengan lokasi atau beritahu kami tentang perniagaan anda.')}</p>{/each}</div>{#if orders.length}<h2>{t('Stripe test orders','Pesanan ujian Stripe')}</h2>{#each orders as o}<div class="order-row"><strong>{t('Custom feasibility report','Laporan kebolehlaksanaan tersuai')}</strong><span>{o.status}</span><span>{money(o.amount/100)}</span></div>{/each}{/if}<div class="dashboard-bottom"><div><span class="eyebrow">{t('YOUR NEXT STEP','LANGKAH SETERUSNYA')}</span><h2>{t('Put your assumptions to the test.','Uji andaian anda.')}</h2><p>{t('Explore an area and see how different costs affect your break-even point.','Terokai kawasan dan lihat kesan kos berbeza terhadap titik pulang modal.')}</p><a class="btn navy" href="#reports">{t('Open a sample report','Buka laporan contoh')}</a></div><div class="subscription-note"><h3>{t('Ongoing support','Sokongan berterusan')}</h3><p>{t('Discuss follow-up research or another location when your business plans change. Scope, evidence and fees are agreed separately.','Bincangkan kajian susulan atau lokasi lain apabila rancangan perniagaan berubah. Skop, bukti dan yuran dipersetujui secara berasingan.')}</p><a href="#consultation">{t('Discuss ongoing support','Bincangkan sokongan berterusan')}</a></div></div></section>
{:else if page==='method'}
 <section class="shell method-page"><span class="eyebrow">{t('SOURCES & METHODOLOGY','SUMBER & METODOLOGI')}</span><h1>{t('Know what','Fahami apa')}<br/><em>{t('the data can tell you.','yang data boleh jelaskan.')}</em></h1><div class="method-grid"><article><h2>{t('What is real','Apa yang sebenar')}</h2><p>{t('The place names, coordinates and mapped features come from OpenStreetMap, retrieved through the public Overpass API. Each area has a saved, dated snapshot so the report remains available during an exhibition.','Nama tempat, koordinat dan ciri dipetakan datang daripada OpenStreetMap melalui API awam Overpass. Setiap kawasan mempunyai snapshot bertarikh supaya laporan tersedia semasa pameran.')}</p><a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">OpenStreetMap · ODbL 1.0</a>{#each areas as a}<p class="fine">{a.name}: {a.fetchedAt.slice(0,10)} · {a.elements.length} {t('mapped features','ciri dipetakan')}<br/>OSM: {a.osmTimestamp}</p>{/each}</article><article><h2>{t('What is a demonstration','Apa yang demonstrasi')}</h2><p>{t('Kopi & Co. Studio and its requests are fictional. Service prices are provisional starting fees. The hero image is an AI-generated illustration, not a customer photograph. Business scenario inputs are editable examples, not local market measurements.','Kopi & Co. Studio dan permintaannya ialah rekaan. Harga perkhidmatan ialah anggaran yuran permulaan. Imej utama ialah ilustrasi janaan AI, bukan foto pelanggan. Input senario perniagaan ialah contoh boleh sunting, bukan ukuran pasaran tempatan.')}</p></article><article><h2>{t('What we do not yet know','Apa yang belum diketahui')}</h2><p>{t('We do not have measured footfall, verified rent, sales histories or a validated demand model. We therefore do not assign a business success score or claim that these reports predict sales. Site suitability needs further research and consultation.','Kami belum mempunyai trafik pejalan kaki yang diukur, sewa disahkan, sejarah jualan atau model permintaan disahkan. Oleh itu kami tidak memberikan skor kejayaan perniagaan atau mendakwa laporan meramal jualan. Kesesuaian tapak memerlukan kajian dan perundingan lanjut.')}</p></article><article><h2>{t('Your data & privacy','Data & privasi anda')}</h2><p>{t('Demo requests are stored on this device and can be reset from the workspace. Account services and payments are deferred in this booth edition. Do not enter sensitive personal information in the exhibition demo.','Permintaan demo disimpan pada peranti ini dan boleh ditetapkan semula dalam ruang kerja. Perkhidmatan akaun dan pembayaran ditangguhkan dalam edisi pameran ini. Jangan masukkan maklumat peribadi sensitif dalam demo pameran.')}</p></article></div></section>
